{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261104/photo/bkn-20261104221327398-1104_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261104222005\"/><p>五旬節中學懷疑被盜竊。(陳嘉順攝)</p><p>今晨(4日)9時22分，何文田巴富街14號五旬節中學的職員報案，指校內有一批電子器材不翼而飛，懷疑遭人盜去。警員接報到場，經初步調查，相信上址一批平板電腦、相機、相機鏡頭和手提電腦被盜，總值約28.7萬港元。案件列作「盜竊」跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:40.439654+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:13:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:05.764650+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:26.677075+00:00","content_hash":"9db664f1765ee05ea808234da582b5639e45e33087fdab1c0a9f281328135880","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:40.439654+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}